# <type>(<scope>): <short description>
# 
# --- Allowed Types ---
# feat     : A new feature (e.g., feat(auth): add phone OTP route)
# fix      : A bug fix (e.g., fix(calendar): resolve double booking bug)
# chore    : Maintenance/config (e.g., chore(deps): install razorpay sdk)
# refactor : Code restructuring without changing behavior
# docs     : Documentation changes
#
# --- Scope Examples ---
# backend, frontend, auth, payments, schema, ui
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Remember: Keep the subject line under 50 characters and use imperative mood!